[0m[32;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mfrom context. All exact-match flags true → source_match="pass" seems natural? But then why wouldn't they say "pass/pass/pass"?[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [0m[33;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[34;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mAlternatively Reading B: source_match="resolved", dependency_registry_status="pass"... but registry status semantics: "missing_target_count":0 → every dependency target resolves → "resolved" fits registry best.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [0m[36;1H [38;5;248mI think the most natural mapping given field names:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       