pass".[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              [0m[62;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248m"canonical_comparison_status": exact matches true → "pass".[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      [0m[63;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[64;1H [38;5;248mThat's Reading A with source_match="pass". The phrase "use resolved/pass/pass when supported" then covers the three explicitly-enumerated status fields whose names appear in the objective's field list in order: dependency_registry_status(resolved), migration_coverage_status(pass), canonical_comparison_status(pass). And source_match, appearing earlier, gets "pass" naturally since all match flags are true.[39m                                                                                            [0m[