                                                                                                                                 [0m[4;1H [38;5;248mAmbiguous. Let me think about which reading is most defensible.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[6;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mReading A: resolved→dependency_registry_status, pass→migration_coverage_status, pass→canonical_comparison_status. Then source_match must be inferred: the storage_source_receipt provides path/sha/lines/bytes, and extraction succeeded against it — source match could be considered "pass" or "resolved". Since the phrase gives exactly the values for the three named statuses matching their semantics (registry "resolves" targets; coverage/validation "passes"), source_match likely also needs a value   [0m[7;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mfrom context. All exact-match flags true → source_match="pass" seems natural? But then why wouldn't they say "pass/pass/pass"?[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [0m[8;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[9;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mAlternatively Reading B: source_match="resolved", dependency_registry_status="pass"... but registry status semantics: "missing_target_count":0 → every dependency target resolves → "resolved" fits registry best.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [0m[11;1H [38;5;248mI think the most natural mapping given field names:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                [0m[12;1H [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mdependency_registry_status: "resolved" (targets resolve)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [0m[13;1H [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mmigration_coverage_status: "pass"[39m                                                                                                  